    <div class="container" style="margin-top: 80px;" id="aff">
      <div style="display: flex; padding: 24px 40px; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 16px; background: rgba(199, 216, 240, 0.20); border-radius: 10px">
        <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #24343F;">
          BigGo Shopping Assistant Affiliate Program Disclosure        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; width: 100%">
          <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border-right: 1px solid #A0AEC6; padding-right: 16px">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #24343F;">
              Affiliate Links and Commission Disclosure            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 14px;">
              To maintain our free price comparison service, BigGo has established affiliate partnerships with various e-commerce platforms. When you complete a purchase through BigGo Shopping Assistant's referral links, we may receive a small commission from our partner merchants. These commissions do not affect your purchase price.            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #24343F;">
              Transparent Link Mechanism            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #24343F;">
              <ul style="padding-left: 16px; margin: 0">
                <li>
                  We do not modify cookies or links without users' knowledge                </li>
                <li>
                  All affiliate referrals are completed through user confirmation (via cashback reward notifications on e-commerce sites) or by clicking products redirected from the BigGo website                </li>
                <li>
                  You are free to choose whether to use our referral links                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding-left: 24px">
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #24343F;">
              Data Collection Statement            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 14px;">
              BigGo Shopping Assistant only collects necessary browsing data and cookie information for:              <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #24343F;">
                <ul style="padding-left: 24px; margin: 0">
                  <li>
                    Tracking product price changes to provide accurate price comparisons                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Confirming your shopping information with partner merchants                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>Please refer to our Privacy Policy for detailed information.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #24343F;">
              Transparency Commitment            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 14px;">
              Affiliate commissions are a source of revenue that supports BigGo's continued operations, allowing us to continue providing you with free and convenient price comparison services. Thank you for your understanding and support.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

